Project Component: Independent Responsive Admin Dashboard (Web & Mobile)
Application Ecosystem: Fe El-Sikka (ف السكه)
Design Theme: Cinematic Premium Dark Mode (Primary Black: #121212, Cards: #1E1E1E, Primary Accent Orange: #FF6B00, Text: #FFFFFF)

Overview:
An independent, cross-platform Admin Dashboard engineered to be fully responsive. It must function flawlessly on Desktop (Web Browsers) and Mobile Screen sizes (App/Mobile Web) for on-the-go management. It connects directly to the shared Firebase database.

----------------------------------------------------------------
1. RESPONSIVE LAYOUT & UX STRUCTURE (Desktop vs Mobile)
----------------------------------------------------------------
- Desktop Layout: Permanent left-sidebar navigation (#1E1E1E) with a spacious main grid showing extensive data tables.
- Mobile Layout: Collapsible Hamburger Menu for navigation. Heavy tables must automatically transform into vertical, scrollable "Card Lists" for easy touch navigation and quick actions on phones.
- Global Theme: Premium Cinematic High-Contrast Dark Mode with neon orange accents.

----------------------------------------------------------------
2. PAGES & MOBILE-RESPONSIVE FUNCTIONALITIES
----------------------------------------------------------------

A. LIVE DISPATCH & ORDER MANAGEMENT:
- Desktop: A full-screen live data grid showing all active orders side-by-side.
- Mobile View: Compact order cards stacked vertically. Each card displays: Customer Phone, Pickup/Dropoff, and a prominent Quick Action button.
- Dispatch System: A vibrant Orange Button labeled "Assign Driver". On mobile, clicking this opens a sleek bottom-sheet menu to quickly tap and select an active driver.

B. FLEET & DRIVER ONBOARDING:
- Driver Controls: Ability to view the driver list, block/activate accounts instantly via toggle switches, and manually register a new driver.
- Form Optimization: Onboard forms must adapt to single-column inputs on mobile for quick typing.

C. MOBILE ACCOUNTING & FINANCIALS:
- KPI Summary Layout: Responsive grid that displays 3 columns on desktop (Total Revenue, Orders, Active Fleet) and stacks into a swipeable carousel or vertical cards on mobile screens.
- Earnings Reports: Simplified view on mobile focusing on "Driver Name" and "Total Owed", expandable to see full ledger details upon tapping.
